+## 10. Performance Characteristics
+
+### stress_test Tool
+- Per-test overhead: ~10-50ms (process startup)
+- Scales: O(num_tests * solution_time)
+- Memory: Stores all test cases and outputs in memory
+
+### benchmark_solution Tool
+- Per-size overhead: ~50-100ms (process startup per run)
+- Scales: O(len(sizes) * runs_per_size * solution_time)
+- Memory: Stores timing data and snippets
+
+### Agent Overhead
+- complexity.md writing: ~1-2s
+- Stress testing: 20 tests × 5s = 100s
+- Benchmarking: 3 runs × 4 sizes × 2s = 24s
+- Total per iteration: ~130s
+- With 3 iterations: ~390s = 6.5 minutes
+
